WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 17]

01:55.520 --> 01:56.310
Something's wrong!

01:57.320 --> 01:58.050
Han!

01:59.350 --> 02:00.100
Miss Mo!

02:00.670 --> 02:01.420
What happened?

02:01.670 --> 02:02.370
We need to get out of the city.

02:02.600 --> 02:03.580
Someone's after us.

02:05.030 --> 02:06.650
I know an old waterway that leads outside.

02:06.870 --> 02:07.690
I'll take you there.

02:12.030 --> 02:12.690
It's this way.

02:20.470 --> 02:21.260
Han...

02:22.320 --> 02:23.650
Why did it suddenly get so dark?

02:29.920 --> 02:30.580
Han.

02:34.390 --> 02:35.050
This path

02:35.110 --> 02:35.650
was something

02:35.670 --> 02:37.300
a patient once told me about.

02:37.470 --> 02:38.620
It leads right out of the city.

02:48.640 --> 02:49.540
Why's it a dead end?

02:57.590 --> 02:57.980
Step back!

02:58.200 --> 02:58.820
Don't get hurt!

03:20.430 --> 03:21.180
I'm Dong Xuan'er.

03:21.310 --> 03:21.980
What's your name?

03:22.200 --> 03:22.980
Mo Caihuan.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.180
I'm a friend of Han Li's.

03:24.480 --> 03:25.020
A friend?

03:25.310 --> 03:26.490
When did you two become friends?

03:26.710 --> 03:27.380
A long time ago.

03:27.840 --> 03:29.130
No wonder he never mentioned you.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.740
We haven't seen each other in years.

03:32.230 --> 03:32.820
I just ran into him.

03:33.150 --> 03:35.330
I wish I had someone to watch fireworks with too.

03:35.950 --> 03:36.460
Move on!

03:36.640 --> 03:37.330
They're catching up!

03:45.470 --> 03:46.260
There's light up ahead!

04:02.190 --> 04:02.980
Sirs,

04:03.310 --> 04:04.780
you must've heard by now

04:04.800 --> 04:06.260
the fall

04:06.360 --> 04:07.220
of Jiang and Cheqi Kingdoms.

04:07.710 --> 04:09.220
The demonic sects have been quiet for years.

04:10.310 --> 04:11.060
But this time,

04:11.400 --> 04:12.380
they're really here.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.260
I heard

04:14.670 --> 04:16.070
those royal families

04:16.070 --> 04:17.610
were secretly learning cultivation,

04:17.750 --> 04:18.730
trying to become cultivators.

04:19.080 --> 04:21.410
They broke the rule barring royals from cultivation.

04:21.960 --> 04:22.850
The demonic sects acted,

04:23.360 --> 04:24.890
and maybe they had a reason.

04:27.030 --> 04:28.410
What's the point

04:28.470 --> 04:29.690
of fighting over scraps?

04:30.080 --> 04:31.850
Righteous or demonic,

04:32.280 --> 04:33.690
why should our Seven Sects

04:33.710 --> 04:35.260
get dragged into this mess?

04:35.430 --> 04:36.850
If we provoke the demonic sects,

04:37.310 --> 04:38.610
they may come after us next.

04:39.120 --> 04:39.850
Exactly.

04:40.470 --> 04:40.980
Everyone,

04:41.560 --> 04:42.380
since we

04:42.470 --> 04:43.940
were all invited here by Hongfu,

04:44.400 --> 04:45.890
let's hear what she has to say.

04:46.800 --> 04:48.220
I heard a Nascent Soul cultivator

04:48.590 --> 04:50.010
is involved in this fight.

04:51.240 --> 04:51.730
Yes,

04:52.190 --> 04:53.940
someone from the Joyful Union Sect,

04:55.080 --> 04:55.940
Grandmaster Yunlu.

04:56.360 --> 04:57.450
Grandmaster Yunlu?

05:08.910 --> 05:10.820
You old geezers, what's that look for?

05:12.120 --> 05:13.220
Talk business if you must,

05:13.680 --> 05:14.730
but keep your eyes off my senior!

05:18.360 --> 05:18.890
All of you,

05:19.840 --> 05:21.660
I didn't call

05:21.710 --> 05:22.340
this meeting.

05:22.910 --> 05:24.570
Nangong Wan from Moonshadow Sect did.

05:26.080 --> 05:26.690
What?

05:27.000 --> 05:27.850
Yan Clan Stronghold sided with the enemy?

05:28.120 --> 05:29.170
I saw it with my own eyes!

05:30.190 --> 05:30.780
Inside Yan Clan Stronghold,

05:31.030 --> 05:32.410
they activated two grand arrays.

05:33.190 --> 05:34.130
Not just to block detection,

05:34.470 --> 05:35.290
they were meant to trap

05:35.310 --> 05:36.690
every Seven Sect disciple

05:36.960 --> 05:38.220
attending the wedding inside the city.

05:38.840 --> 05:40.060
On the surface, it was a wedding feast.

05:40.560 --> 05:41.130
But in truth,

05:41.400 --> 05:42.450
Yan Clan worked with the demon sects

05:42.520 --> 05:43.410
to set us up.

05:44.800 --> 05:45.290
This...

05:46.150 --> 05:47.290
this can't be true.

05:48.630 --> 05:49.450
I didn't dare delay.

05:49.680 --> 05:50.410
As soon as I realized it,

05:50.680 --> 05:51.890
I rushed back to report.

05:55.040 --> 05:56.050
I should've seen it coming.

05:57.160 --> 05:58.410
Yan Clan Stronghold is right on the border,

05:59.240 --> 06:00.290
next to the Jiang Kingdom.

06:00.920 --> 06:02.050
Yan Ruyan's wedding,

06:02.510 --> 06:03.490
and what happened to Qing...

06:04.240 --> 06:05.410
With so many red flags,

06:05.870 --> 06:06.980
how did I miss them?

06:08.610 --> 06:10.120
You've been more than cautious, Grandmaster.

06:10.660 --> 06:11.720
If you hadn't warned me

06:11.720 --> 06:12.720
to keep an eye on the demonic sects,

06:13.140 --> 06:13.740
I wouldn't have gone

06:13.840 --> 06:15.350
to investigate Yan Clan Stronghold.

06:16.600 --> 06:18.490
The Seven Sects are still in the dark.

06:19.680 --> 06:19.980
Come.

06:20.070 --> 06:20.980
We're going to Yellow Maple Valley.

06:22.750 --> 06:23.580
Yellow Maple Valley?

06:23.800 --> 06:25.100
They're holding a meeting there now.

06:25.630 --> 06:26.930
I want you to tell them everything you know,

06:27.240 --> 06:27.930
start to finish,

06:28.070 --> 06:29.250
every last detail.

06:30.160 --> 06:30.490
Let's move.

06:44.000 --> 06:44.410
Han!

06:44.680 --> 06:45.460
My powers are back!

06:45.750 --> 06:47.460
We must be outside the array now.

06:47.720 --> 06:48.100
Move on!

07:11.840 --> 07:12.570
He's on us!

07:13.110 --> 07:13.780
You two, leave!

07:14.160 --> 07:15.140
We're surrounded by open land.

07:15.310 --> 07:16.020
We won't outrun him.

07:16.560 --> 07:17.340
Miss Mo, you leave first!

07:17.600 --> 07:18.730
Han and I will hold him off!

07:19.240 --> 07:20.020
Then you two...

07:20.390 --> 07:20.780
Go! Now!

07:21.510 --> 07:21.850
Hurry!

07:22.000 --> 07:22.930
Stay safe!

08:16.720 --> 08:17.580
Junior,

08:18.830 --> 08:19.850
we meet again!

08:20.000 --> 08:20.460
You fiend!

08:20.680 --> 08:21.610
Why do you keep coming after me?

08:32.720 --> 08:33.900
Boy from Yellow Maple Valley,

08:34.630 --> 08:36.780
I underestimated you before.

08:38.240 --> 08:39.930
State your identity!

08:40.160 --> 08:42.170
I don't kill nobodies!

08:43.070 --> 08:43.730
Li Feiyu,

08:44.160 --> 08:44.700
disciple of Yellow Maple Valley.

08:45.480 --> 08:46.220
Nothing worth bragging about.

08:47.920 --> 08:49.900
Li Feiyu?

08:52.680 --> 08:55.020
You keep ruining my plans!

08:55.950 --> 08:58.250
Looks like you're a standout

08:59.430 --> 09:01.290
from that shabby sect after all?

09:01.950 --> 09:03.220
With how clueless you are,

09:03.680 --> 09:04.850
you dare speak like a real master?

09:05.870 --> 09:06.660
Let me set you straight.

09:07.560 --> 09:09.140
In Yellow Maple Valley, Core cultivators are common,

09:09.510 --> 09:10.460
and Foundation cultivators are everywhere.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.610
I'm just a nobody myself.

09:13.360 --> 09:14.250
But taking you down?

09:14.950 --> 09:16.100
A piece of cake!

09:18.310 --> 09:18.930
Nice.

09:24.830 --> 09:25.930
This blood mist can regenerate!

09:26.360 --> 09:26.730
Run!

09:27.800 --> 09:29.050
Die!

10:05.600 --> 10:06.140
Fly up!

10:23.240 --> 10:24.580
No one's getting away!

10:45.670 --> 10:46.420
Head back!

10:57.750 --> 10:59.530
We need to escape before the array seals off!

11:03.790 --> 11:04.850
Still trying to run?

11:12.120 --> 11:13.610
The flying talismans burn out fast!

11:13.870 --> 11:14.890
I can't hold on much longer!

11:15.390 --> 11:16.730
I've got one talisman left.

11:17.030 --> 11:17.820
I'll send you out!

11:18.200 --> 11:19.100
What about you?

11:19.750 --> 11:20.460
I'll figure something out!

11:34.040 --> 11:34.850
At least she's safe.

11:35.590 --> 11:36.660
If my elders ask,

11:37.280 --> 11:38.180
I'll have an answer.

11:44.960 --> 11:45.970
Don't die!

11:46.350 --> 11:47.490
You have to come back alive!

11:54.670 --> 11:55.290
All right then,

11:56.120 --> 11:58.060
I'll keep you company for a bit.

11:58.670 --> 11:59.260
So tell me,

11:59.630 --> 12:00.970
how do you want to die?

12:02.600 --> 12:03.410
Running into you today,

12:03.750 --> 12:04.730
looks like I've lost this round.

12:05.070 --> 12:06.330
What happened in the Bloody Trial Ground

12:06.430 --> 12:07.290
was your doing too, right?

12:07.600 --> 12:08.650
Recruiting spies from the Seven Sects,

12:08.750 --> 12:09.690
and stealing from Yan Clan Stronghold,

12:11.310 --> 12:12.500
you've got quite the operation going.

12:13.070 --> 12:14.500
What's your next move?

12:15.240 --> 12:16.610
At least let me die knowing the plan.

12:19.280 --> 12:20.940
Cut the crap.

12:21.560 --> 12:23.730
You think I don't see through you?

12:24.200 --> 12:25.780
You're just buying time for those two women

12:25.920 --> 12:26.860
to get away.

12:27.710 --> 12:29.290
You think I'm an idiot?

12:30.110 --> 12:30.820
Wow, you're real clever.

12:33.110 --> 12:34.250
Kid,

12:36.640 --> 12:38.220
time to die!

12:50.190 --> 12:50.940
Seriously?

12:51.470 --> 12:53.090
You need this much firepower for one guy?

13:41.360 --> 13:41.850
Luckily,

13:42.320 --> 13:43.020
he's huge,

13:43.320 --> 13:43.900
but clumsy.

13:44.360 --> 13:44.900
I can still take him.

13:51.830 --> 13:52.410
My Cyan Mirror...

13:53.150 --> 13:53.500
Oh no!

13:53.920 --> 13:54.410
It can't hold on!

13:58.800 --> 14:00.340
You came loaded with artifacts!

14:12.800 --> 14:13.460
Azure Drake Banner!

14:13.920 --> 14:14.340
Go!

14:27.970 --> 14:29.030
Cyan Sword Technique!

14:42.110 --> 14:43.340
His cultivation's above mine.

14:43.800 --> 14:44.340
I can't go head-to-head!

14:55.550 --> 14:56.500
What is this?

14:56.960 --> 14:57.780
So flashy and useless.

15:07.430 --> 15:08.340
Get over here!

15:23.640 --> 15:25.570
Blood Spirit Spell, Form Ten...

15:26.920 --> 15:28.180
Blood Burst!

15:32.830 --> 15:33.340
Too bad!

15:37.760 --> 15:38.810
Got you at last!

15:41.870 --> 15:43.940
Now die!

16:19.030 --> 16:19.660
No,

16:19.910 --> 16:20.980
this smoke is toxic...

16:22.440 --> 16:23.250
That Azure Smoke

16:23.640 --> 16:24.890
is made from Blackflood Drake venom.

16:26.080 --> 16:26.810
I earned it

16:27.520 --> 16:28.770
back in the Bloody Trial Ground!

16:29.390 --> 16:30.210
You really have

16:30.960 --> 16:32.300
no shame!

16:34.440 --> 16:35.660
With someone like you,

16:36.320 --> 16:37.770
any method is fair game.

16:38.030 --> 16:38.570
You're...

16:38.790 --> 16:40.010
you're even more demonic than I am!

16:51.960 --> 16:53.890
Well played, Li Feiyu...

16:55.030 --> 16:56.690
I won't forget this!

17:04.680 --> 17:05.620
I finally drove him off.

17:06.200 --> 17:06.810
Any longer,

17:07.000 --> 17:07.660
I'd be in trouble too.

17:12.120 --> 17:13.450
This is a Core elder discussion.

17:14.230 --> 17:15.620
You brought a Foundation disciple here?

17:16.120 --> 17:16.890
Is that really appropriate?

17:19.000 --> 17:20.300
This is Xuan Yue,

17:20.440 --> 17:20.940
my disciple.

17:21.320 --> 17:22.770
He's been handling our contact with Yan Clan Stronghold.

17:23.120 --> 17:23.860
Now we know

17:24.120 --> 17:24.860
they're a serious problem.

17:25.560 --> 17:26.450
Now tell everyone

17:26.590 --> 17:27.330
what you know.

17:30.520 --> 17:31.180
Sirs,

17:32.200 --> 17:33.210
I saw it myself.

17:33.960 --> 17:34.740
Yan Clan Stronghold

17:34.910 --> 17:36.130
teamed up with the demonic sects

17:36.470 --> 17:37.300
to set a trap.

17:38.000 --> 17:39.620
All the Seven Sect disciples at the wedding

17:40.470 --> 17:42.010
were sealed and killed inside the city.

17:45.710 --> 17:46.300
What?

17:46.830 --> 17:47.570
All of them died?

17:50.640 --> 17:51.500
What are you saying?

17:53.200 --> 17:54.130
That can't be true!

17:56.640 --> 17:57.210
The demonic sects

17:57.270 --> 17:58.860
never planned to spare Yue Kingdom.

17:59.350 --> 18:00.690
They struck Yan Clan Stronghold today,

18:00.960 --> 18:02.420
but tomorrow it can be all Seven Sects!

18:11.320 --> 18:11.860
Xuan'er...

18:42.720 --> 18:43.330
Yan!

18:45.920 --> 18:46.530
Yan!

18:47.350 --> 18:48.180
Yan, you're awake!

18:48.550 --> 18:49.090
Father?

18:50.000 --> 18:50.420
Father!

18:51.070 --> 18:51.940
You're finally awake!

18:53.510 --> 18:53.860
I...

18:54.030 --> 18:54.660
How do you feel?

18:54.750 --> 18:56.290
Wasn't I supposed to be at Moonshadow Sect?

18:56.550 --> 18:57.660
Do you feel unwell?

18:59.960 --> 19:01.090
Why am I dressed like this?

19:01.720 --> 19:02.290
Don't panic.

19:02.750 --> 19:03.460
Listen to me.

19:06.310 --> 19:07.730
So much has happened

19:09.160 --> 19:10.290
while you were unconscious.

19:11.200 --> 19:12.090
All I can tell you is,

19:12.640 --> 19:14.530
you're now married to Wang Chan,

19:15.590 --> 19:16.530
heir to Ghost Spirit Sect.

19:17.720 --> 19:18.420
Our clan

19:19.790 --> 19:21.490
has officially joined the Ghost Spirit Sect.

19:23.680 --> 19:24.220
Father,

19:24.510 --> 19:25.460
what are you talking about?

19:25.680 --> 19:26.940
The Ghost Spirit Sect is demonic!

19:27.270 --> 19:29.090
Are you really defying the Seven Sects of Yue?

19:30.030 --> 19:30.940
The Seven Sects?

19:31.880 --> 19:32.420
Yan,

19:33.790 --> 19:34.940
don't blame me.

19:35.880 --> 19:37.010
When you were gravely ill,

19:37.880 --> 19:38.530
did anyone from the Seven Sects

19:38.680 --> 19:40.010
care about you?

19:42.680 --> 19:43.940
I didn't want to betray them.

19:44.590 --> 19:46.220
They forced my hand!

19:48.550 --> 19:49.420
To save you,

19:51.240 --> 19:52.490
this was the only way.

20:02.240 --> 20:03.620
I can feel within me

20:04.030 --> 20:05.700
their wrongly spilled spirits.

20:07.510 --> 20:08.290
So...

20:09.920 --> 20:11.770
they died because of me?

20:14.790 --> 20:16.180
If they hadn't died,

20:18.030 --> 20:19.570
you couldn't have lived.

20:20.720 --> 20:21.330
Father...

20:22.590 --> 20:24.090
How could you do this?

20:25.440 --> 20:27.860
We've stood against the demonic sects for 300 years!

20:28.350 --> 20:29.290
Now, just because of me,

20:30.240 --> 20:32.810
you've joined forces with them?

20:34.590 --> 20:35.730
If I had known,

20:36.030 --> 20:37.660
I'd rather you never saved me!

20:38.790 --> 20:39.940
I'm going back to Moonshadow Sect!

20:40.070 --> 20:40.530
Yan!

20:40.880 --> 20:41.770
Stop, Yan!

20:50.750 --> 20:51.180
Yan!

20:51.640 --> 20:52.220
Are you okay?

20:52.960 --> 20:53.330
Yan,

20:53.590 --> 20:53.980
are you alright?

20:54.350 --> 20:54.730
Yan!

20:56.310 --> 20:56.730
Yan,

20:57.440 --> 20:59.220
you can't go back now!

21:01.680 --> 21:03.620
Your husband, Wang Chan, used the Blood Spirit Spell

21:04.590 --> 21:06.250
and the blood of Seven Sect cultivators

21:06.510 --> 21:07.460
to bring you back to life.

21:08.070 --> 21:10.090
You think you can go back?

21:11.030 --> 21:11.770
Moonshadow Sect

21:13.110 --> 21:14.180
and all the Seven Sects

21:16.000 --> 21:18.220
see us as enemies now!

21:18.750 --> 21:20.570
You can't go back anymore!

21:34.240 --> 21:35.290
I'm old.

21:36.640 --> 21:38.140
My cultivation in this lifetime

21:40.880 --> 21:41.660
has likely

21:42.550 --> 21:43.980
hit its limit.

21:46.110 --> 21:47.220
But you're different.

21:48.920 --> 21:50.380
You have a heavenly spirit root.

21:51.480 --> 21:53.050
On the path of cultivation,

21:54.350 --> 21:56.140
you have limitless potential!

21:57.830 --> 21:59.010
I've always believed

22:00.000 --> 22:01.140
you'll become

22:01.400 --> 22:02.250
our clan's

22:02.720 --> 22:04.330
first Nascent Soul cultivator.

22:07.070 --> 22:08.620
With you protecting us,

22:10.790 --> 22:13.140
no one will dare bully us again!

22:15.720 --> 22:16.380
Yan,

22:17.160 --> 22:18.860
I had to save you,

22:20.270 --> 22:22.530
not just because you're my daughter,

22:24.880 --> 22:25.770
but also because...

22:27.160 --> 22:27.770
you...

22:28.720 --> 22:31.490
you're the future of our clan!

23:11.350 --> 23:13.180
That burden

23:15.640 --> 23:17.460
is now yours to carry.

23:32.960 --> 23:33.980
Thanks for your sharing.

23:35.110 --> 23:35.660
Don't mention it.

23:36.440 --> 23:37.900
I talked too much.

23:38.070 --> 23:38.730
That must've tired you out.

23:41.240 --> 23:42.090
Just how far

23:42.160 --> 23:43.570
has the demonic sects' plan come?

23:44.200 --> 23:45.250
Nangong,

23:45.510 --> 23:46.290
please tell us everything you know.

23:46.880 --> 23:48.290
To be honest, we noticed it too.

23:48.720 --> 23:50.530
You were holding back earlier.

23:51.270 --> 23:52.570
Normally, we shouldn't press you,

23:53.270 --> 23:53.860
but...

23:55.440 --> 23:56.620
this concerns the survival of the Seven Sects.

23:57.070 --> 23:58.090
We have to ask further.

24:01.920 --> 24:02.700
Some time ago,

24:03.110 --> 24:04.330
I fought a demonic cultivator

24:04.480 --> 24:06.180
who'd infiltrated

24:06.550 --> 24:07.180
Yue Kingdom.

24:07.550 --> 24:08.250
He said

24:08.750 --> 24:09.620
they've already won over

24:10.160 --> 24:11.660
some Core cultivators in Yue.

24:13.070 --> 24:14.140
Even Core cultivators

24:14.480 --> 24:15.490
have betrayed us.

24:16.550 --> 24:17.940
No wonder they kept stalling,

24:17.960 --> 24:18.730
turning a blind eye.

24:19.350 --> 24:20.460
So they've become traitors.

24:22.750 --> 24:23.620
Can we trust

24:24.160 --> 24:24.700
what that man said?

24:25.680 --> 24:26.730
At this point,

24:26.920 --> 24:28.940
nothing can be trusted completely anymore.

24:29.590 --> 24:30.330
I'm only telling you this

24:30.750 --> 24:31.810
so the Seven Sects understand

24:32.160 --> 24:33.140
we can't just focus on what's in front of us.

24:33.640 --> 24:34.420
We need to watch our back.

24:36.240 --> 24:37.620
Thanks for your warning.

24:37.830 --> 24:38.860
Yellow Maple Valley will take it to heart.

24:39.790 --> 24:40.420
Right now,

24:40.960 --> 24:42.180
Yan Clan Stronghold has defected,

24:43.240 --> 24:43.860
leaving Yue Kingdom

24:44.070 --> 24:45.180
wide open to invasion.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.250
Do you have a strategy?

24:49.000 --> 24:50.090
The demonic sects are closing in fast.

24:51.270 --> 24:52.090
Even Nascent Soul cultivators

24:52.270 --> 24:53.010
have joined the battle.

24:53.440 --> 24:54.380
Our best option

24:54.640 --> 24:56.010
is for each sect to send

24:56.400 --> 24:57.330
their own Nascent Soul elders

24:57.590 --> 24:59.090
to handle the conflict at their level.

24:59.680 --> 25:01.010
That way, we can keep mortals out of it.

25:01.270 --> 25:01.980
Of course.

25:02.880 --> 25:04.050
You've thought it through.

25:05.000 --> 25:05.460
In addition,

25:05.590 --> 25:07.140
battles between Core cultivators

25:07.400 --> 25:08.660
will be key to deciding the outcome.

25:08.920 --> 25:10.980
We need Core cultivators stationed

25:11.240 --> 25:12.090
on every front line

25:12.440 --> 25:13.250
to fend off the demon assault.

25:14.000 --> 25:14.460
Agreed.

25:15.590 --> 25:16.900
Now that Yan Clan Stronghold has fallen,

25:17.240 --> 25:18.860
Yellow Maple Valley and Moonshadow Sect

25:19.240 --> 25:20.220
must be the first line

25:20.400 --> 25:21.220
of defense.

25:21.880 --> 25:22.660
Junior Li and I

25:22.880 --> 25:24.330
will each lead a unit into battle.

25:25.590 --> 25:26.730
Your resolve is admirable.

25:26.920 --> 25:27.530
I'm deeply impressed.

25:28.550 --> 25:29.140
Third,

25:30.030 --> 25:32.490
it's time to send in elite Foundation disciples.

25:33.160 --> 25:34.460
We need to form scout teams.

25:34.680 --> 25:36.330
They'll rescue survivors near Yan Clan Stronghold

25:37.270 --> 25:38.140
and gather intel on the enemy.

25:38.550 --> 25:39.620
If anything comes up,

25:39.680 --> 25:40.460
they'll report it immediately.

25:40.920 --> 25:41.730
Moonshadow Sect will have

25:42.350 --> 25:43.180
Xuan Yue lead the squad.

25:43.720 --> 25:44.570
This mission

25:44.720 --> 25:46.660
is part of our build-up to a full counterattack.

25:48.030 --> 25:48.900
I take the mission.

25:49.720 --> 25:50.620
Xuan Yue,

25:52.070 --> 25:53.250
are you sure

25:54.240 --> 25:55.900
not a single Seven Sect disciple made it out?

25:58.000 --> 25:58.620
Reporting:

25:59.030 --> 26:00.660
I couldn't confirm on the spot,

26:01.550 --> 26:02.220
but I fear

26:03.240 --> 26:03.900
most didn't survive...

26:06.200 --> 26:07.180
Don't worry, Senior.

26:07.720 --> 26:08.770
That little disciple of mine

26:08.920 --> 26:09.730
is always careful to a fault.

26:10.550 --> 26:11.290
Before he left,

26:11.440 --> 26:12.530
he promised again and again

26:12.880 --> 26:14.090
he'd look after Xuan'er.

26:14.550 --> 26:15.620
If anyone survived,

26:15.790 --> 26:17.050
it must be the two of them.

26:19.350 --> 26:21.010
But Han Li's only a Foundation cultivator...

26:24.550 --> 26:25.180
Han Li?

26:26.000 --> 26:26.980
He went to Yan Clan Stronghold?

26:27.920 --> 26:29.220
He can't have died just like that.

27:02.440 --> 27:03.090
Miss Mo!

27:08.350 --> 27:08.980
Han!

27:15.030 --> 27:15.570
Hurry, get on!

28:09.200 --> 28:09.860
Han,

28:10.680 --> 28:11.700
are you badly hurt?

28:13.480 --> 28:13.860
I'm fine.

28:14.550 --> 28:15.420
I already took a healing pill.

28:18.550 --> 28:20.290
What about that man chasing us?

28:20.920 --> 28:22.010
Did you kill him?

28:22.790 --> 28:23.330
No.

28:24.350 --> 28:25.380
But he didn't walk away happy.

28:40.880 --> 28:41.700
Then what?

28:43.440 --> 28:44.460
What's your next move?

28:56.200 --> 28:57.090
There's a village up ahead.

28:58.030 --> 28:58.770
You can lie low there for a while.

29:00.960 --> 29:01.860
Then head to the Imperial Capital.

29:02.920 --> 29:03.810
It's safer than Yan Clan Stronghold.

29:05.830 --> 29:07.860
Last time we met was ten years ago...

29:09.510 --> 29:11.660
Who knows when the next time will be?

29:13.550 --> 29:15.730
You cultivators live so long,

29:16.680 --> 29:17.900
but I'm just a mortal.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.700
How many decades do I really have?

29:21.110 --> 29:22.730
Can I even wait that long?

29:42.400 --> 29:43.090
Han, are you fine?

29:45.830 --> 29:46.290
It's all right.

29:50.640 --> 29:51.180
Miss Mo,

29:52.200 --> 29:53.460
this is as far as I can take you.

29:54.920 --> 29:56.010
If I'm right,

29:56.880 --> 29:57.940
a major war is coming

29:58.830 --> 29:59.810
to the cultivation world.

30:03.200 --> 30:04.220
I've got some pills here.

30:05.030 --> 30:06.050
You can keep them for yourself,

30:06.720 --> 30:07.730
or sell them for money.

30:09.830 --> 30:10.940
Go settle down in the capital,

30:11.830 --> 30:13.090
and try to live a peaceful life.

30:19.590 --> 30:20.620
I don't need them.

30:27.720 --> 30:28.290
Miss Mo,

30:29.880 --> 30:30.810
we part ways today.

30:32.240 --> 30:33.490
Who knows when we'll meet again?

30:40.590 --> 30:41.330
Take care of yourself.

30:54.310 --> 30:55.180
Han...

30:56.640 --> 30:58.180
If I have a spirit root,

31:01.790 --> 31:04.090
I'll be able to stay by your side, right?

31:15.680 --> 31:16.700
You're always like this.

31:19.830 --> 31:21.330
Whenever the question gets hard,

31:26.000 --> 31:27.010
you just go quiet...

31:29.580 --> 31:33.780
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

31:35.860 --> 31:39.900
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

31:41.780 --> 31:44.380
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on...♪

31:44.400 --> 31:44.940
Miss Mo...

31:45.300 --> 31:47.180
♪Old scenes rise again...♪

31:48.070 --> 31:48.490
Take care.

31:48.740 --> 31:54.340
♪Too hard to forget, easier just to miss♪

31:56.260 --> 32:00.740
♪They say the past fades like smoke...♪

32:06.440 --> 32:07.140
Han...

32:09.070 --> 32:09.490
Take care of yourself.

32:11.740 --> 32:13.940
♪Swept away by time♪

32:15.260 --> 32:21.140
♪Eyes once looked far, now lost in the shift♪

32:22.100 --> 32:27.260
♪Autumn winds stir, smoke curls once more♪

32:28.060 --> 32:33.300
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky, returning to my eyes♪

32:35.060 --> 32:39.980
♪Looking back from the mountaintop, time lost its name♪

32:41.540 --> 32:47.500
♪Was it yesterday or tomorrow?♪

32:48.460 --> 32:53.700
♪The world has changed, beyond recall♪

32:54.300 --> 32:57.020
♪Time will fade♪

32:57.580 --> 32:59.900
♪All the words ever spoken♪

33:01.380 --> 33:04.420
♪Only this longing remains♪

33:04.980 --> 33:10.300
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

33:12.100 --> 33:18.140
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

33:18.780 --> 33:27.900
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪

33:48.790 --> 33:50.330
He's not really dead, is he?

33:54.590 --> 33:55.330
Grandmaster.

33:56.270 --> 33:56.810
What is it?

33:57.640 --> 33:59.180
You sent me to find royal bloodlines

33:59.200 --> 34:00.570
from Cheqi and Jiang Kingdoms.

34:01.200 --> 34:02.700
I only returned with two children.

34:06.640 --> 34:07.420
Keep them in our sect.

34:08.070 --> 34:08.810
If they have spirit roots,

34:09.240 --> 34:10.250
train them.

34:11.400 --> 34:12.140
If not,

34:13.880 --> 34:15.460
find them good homes.

34:16.030 --> 34:16.570
Understood.

34:17.880 --> 34:18.530
Grandmaster,

34:19.030 --> 34:20.220
I discovered something strange

34:20.350 --> 34:22.330
while I was undercover in both kingdoms.

34:22.920 --> 34:24.530
The demonic sects were gathering

34:24.640 --> 34:25.620
entire populations together

34:26.200 --> 34:27.090
to test for spirit roots.

34:27.830 --> 34:29.220
Anyone who had one

34:29.590 --> 34:30.730
was taken away on the spot,

34:31.270 --> 34:32.570
even children weren't spared.

34:38.240 --> 34:39.420
They're downright monstrous.

34:40.000 --> 34:41.330
Aren't they afraid of incurring heaven's wrath?

34:42.920 --> 34:43.700
Ma'am,

34:44.350 --> 34:45.220
why would they do

34:45.510 --> 34:46.420
something like that?

34:47.270 --> 34:49.050
They're forcing people to cultivate fast.

34:49.590 --> 34:50.380
Then using forbidden techniques

34:50.640 --> 34:51.900
to rush them into higher stages.

34:52.550 --> 34:54.180
Finally send them to the front lines.

34:55.440 --> 34:56.090
As for those people,

34:56.440 --> 34:57.490
even if they survive,

34:57.960 --> 34:58.770
their foundation's ruined.

35:00.000 --> 35:00.940
They won't live long anyway.

35:28.110 --> 35:28.660
Who goes there?

35:31.590 --> 35:32.570
Congrats, Young Master!

35:32.680 --> 35:33.530
Hail the Young Master!

35:33.720 --> 35:34.420
Young Master,

35:34.550 --> 35:35.490
you're peerless!

35:35.880 --> 35:36.810
With just a bit of trickery,

35:37.270 --> 35:38.860
you took Yan Clan Stronghold effortlessly.

35:39.480 --> 35:40.330
With the Seven Sects,

35:40.590 --> 35:41.250
you'll crush them

35:41.510 --> 35:42.420
just as easily!

35:42.640 --> 35:43.140
Get lost!

35:51.400 --> 35:51.900
Oh, Young Master,

35:52.550 --> 35:53.780
you're seriously hurt.

35:56.360 --> 35:58.170
The Bloody Trial Ground...

35:59.550 --> 36:00.940
Blackflood Drake's poison...

36:06.150 --> 36:06.980
Zhong Wu,

36:08.550 --> 36:10.210
you know a lot about the Seven Great Sects.

36:11.190 --> 36:13.050
You went to the Bloody Trial Ground too.

36:14.360 --> 36:15.650
Did you come across someone

36:15.710 --> 36:18.780
named Li Feiyu from Yellow Maple Valley?

36:21.230 --> 36:21.650
Young Master,

36:21.800 --> 36:22.740
I was too busy

36:23.230 --> 36:24.420
stirring up trouble at the time.

36:24.590 --> 36:26.090
Who could remember names?

36:26.590 --> 36:26.980
Here's an idea.

36:27.280 --> 36:29.010
Once we take Yellow Maple Valley,

36:29.150 --> 36:30.170
I'll round them all up,

36:30.440 --> 36:31.260
and deliver him straight to you.

36:33.400 --> 36:34.010
Problem solved.

36:39.630 --> 36:40.650
Then put out the order.

36:42.070 --> 36:43.820
Find out where he went.

36:44.920 --> 36:47.130
He's hurt worse than I am.

36:48.440 --> 36:49.260
He can't have gone far.

36:50.320 --> 36:51.130
Of course!

36:51.880 --> 36:53.010
There's no way he got far!

36:53.800 --> 36:54.460
Wait.

36:56.880 --> 36:58.460
How's Yan Ruyan doing?

37:00.000 --> 37:01.050
She's awake.

37:01.280 --> 37:02.940
But she probably realized

37:03.360 --> 37:04.090
her home is gone

37:04.190 --> 37:04.860
and she got married in her sleep.

37:05.000 --> 37:06.340
That's a lot to take in.

37:06.710 --> 37:08.010
She won't speak to anyone now.

37:14.360 --> 37:15.530
The game's already set.

37:16.800 --> 37:17.860
She has no say in it.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.780
Let me rest a bit, will you?

37:24.760 --> 37:25.570
I'm off now!

38:00.150 --> 38:01.900
What a fine mood you're in, dear.

38:04.360 --> 38:05.340
Let's properly introduce ourselves.

38:05.960 --> 38:06.690
My name is Wang Chan,

38:07.360 --> 38:08.340
Young Master of Ghost Spirit Sect,

38:08.880 --> 38:10.130
and your new husband.

38:16.440 --> 38:16.900
You vile scum.

38:18.630 --> 38:19.900
You'd better kill me now,

38:20.480 --> 38:21.650
or I swear one day

38:22.000 --> 38:22.820
I will kill you!

38:23.150 --> 38:24.610
If you really want revenge,

38:25.230 --> 38:26.210
then dual cultivate with me.

38:27.440 --> 38:28.610
Once your powers grow

38:29.150 --> 38:30.740
and you reach Nascent Soul, come and try.

38:31.550 --> 38:32.340
Shameless!

38:35.110 --> 38:36.300
I just wonder

38:37.920 --> 38:39.490
will you really kill your dear husband?

38:41.400 --> 38:42.650
Well, broad daylight and all,

38:43.190 --> 38:44.940
congrats on your big day!

38:49.960 --> 38:50.650
Aunt,

38:51.190 --> 38:52.740
I should be congratulating you.

38:53.150 --> 38:54.740
You just took Cheqi Kingdom,

38:54.960 --> 38:55.820
and made Grandmaster Yunlu

38:55.840 --> 38:57.130
grin ear to ear.

38:57.960 --> 38:59.090
Sweet talker, aren't you?

38:59.510 --> 39:01.610
You handled the Yan Clan Stronghold business well.

39:01.880 --> 39:02.940
I've already put in a good word

39:03.230 --> 39:04.340
with my brother for you.

39:05.000 --> 39:06.010
He was so pleased.

39:06.190 --> 39:07.490
He couldn't stop smiling.

39:09.510 --> 39:10.300
Thanks, Aunt.

39:10.960 --> 39:11.690
That said,

39:12.880 --> 39:14.010
in Yan Clan Stronghold,

39:14.880 --> 39:15.900
you did lose

39:15.920 --> 39:17.980
to some no-name from Yellow Maple Valley.

39:18.440 --> 39:19.490
If my brother knows it,

39:19.960 --> 39:21.130
he won't be thrilled.

39:24.400 --> 39:25.090
Understood.

39:26.150 --> 39:27.210
I'll take it to heart,

39:28.400 --> 39:29.420
and be more careful next time.

39:31.400 --> 39:33.820
Truly your father's son,

39:34.440 --> 39:35.300
sharp and sensible!

39:40.110 --> 39:41.860
Oh, you're badly injured.

39:42.550 --> 39:44.090
You should stay out of the fight

39:44.280 --> 39:45.130
with the Seven Sects.

39:45.510 --> 39:46.300
What? Why?

39:46.590 --> 39:47.490
I'm almost healed!

39:48.280 --> 39:49.210
Why the rush?

39:50.440 --> 39:52.260
Yan Clan Stronghold just surrendered.

39:52.960 --> 39:54.940
And as their new live-in son-in-law,

39:55.230 --> 39:57.340
shouldn't you be home doting on your bride?

39:58.670 --> 40:00.050
Leave the fighting

40:00.590 --> 40:01.460
to others.

40:04.400 --> 40:05.530
Even my brother,

40:06.510 --> 40:07.860
I mean, your father, agrees.

40:14.880 --> 40:15.780
Things are tense

40:15.960 --> 40:16.940
on the battlefield.

40:17.960 --> 40:18.780
We can't spare anyone

40:18.840 --> 40:19.940
for the front lines.

40:20.590 --> 40:22.650
We've already drafted

40:23.030 --> 40:25.300
a huge number of mortals from Jiang and Cheqi.

40:25.920 --> 40:26.490
Mortals?

40:29.110 --> 40:31.460
They're all mortals with spirit roots.

40:34.150 --> 40:34.740
Anyway,

40:35.550 --> 40:37.010
get back to your sweet little bride

40:37.230 --> 40:37.980
and keep her company!

40:49.360 --> 40:50.420
Forgive my aunt, dear.

40:51.630 --> 40:53.210
This is the real face of the Ghost Spirit Sect.

40:54.320 --> 40:55.170
You'll have to get used to it.

40:58.030 --> 40:59.460
She's your actual aunt?

41:00.800 --> 41:01.210
Yes.

41:02.840 --> 41:03.780
But she's also probably...

41:05.920 --> 41:07.780
the one who most wants me dead.

41:15.070 --> 41:16.420
Your family

41:16.440 --> 41:17.900
is really something else.

41:21.960 --> 41:22.740
Well, going forward,

41:23.150 --> 41:24.690
they'll be your family too.

41:26.800 --> 41:27.570
Don't worry.

41:29.230 --> 41:29.940
In the future,

41:29.960 --> 41:32.010
I'll need you desperately.

41:33.630 --> 41:35.010
But I may betray you anytime,

41:35.440 --> 41:36.090
and use you for my own ends.

41:38.030 --> 41:38.740
Of course,

41:40.230 --> 41:42.380
you're free to betray me too,

41:43.480 --> 41:44.260
and use me however you like.

41:45.590 --> 41:46.130
Dear.

41:52.030 --> 41:53.340
As for the Yan Clan Stronghold situation,

41:54.000 --> 41:55.210
I assume everyone's already heard.

41:55.670 --> 41:56.570
The demonic sects are running wild.

41:57.400 --> 41:58.260
We can't let our guard down.

41:59.030 --> 42:00.420
On orders from the Seven Sects' elders,

42:01.150 --> 42:02.090
we from Yellow Maple Valley

42:02.550 --> 42:03.820
must also send disciples

42:04.150 --> 42:06.100
to join the joint scout teams.

42:07.030 --> 42:08.820
You're heading to Yan Clan Stronghold

42:09.320 --> 42:10.130
to investigate the situation.

42:11.550 --> 42:12.460
Who's willing to go?

42:13.510 --> 42:14.210
I volunteer, Wu Xuan!

42:15.280 --> 42:16.260
Chen Qiaoqian volunteers!

42:16.880 --> 42:17.380
You?

42:17.960 --> 42:18.900
This mission is dangerous.

42:19.760 --> 42:20.940
You've just reached Foundation Establishment Stage.

42:21.710 --> 42:22.260
I'm afraid...

42:22.480 --> 42:23.210
Senior,

42:24.070 --> 42:25.340
I gained little

42:25.880 --> 42:26.860
from the Bloody Trial Ground.

42:27.920 --> 42:29.610
I made no contributions to our sect,

42:30.360 --> 42:31.650
yet was granted a Foundation Pill.

42:32.670 --> 42:33.740
Though I succeeded in my breakthrough,

42:34.280 --> 42:35.130
if I keep coasting like this,

42:35.920 --> 42:37.010
I may develop inner demons.

42:39.150 --> 42:40.300
Now that the demonic sects have invaded,

42:40.960 --> 42:42.490
and I share ties

42:42.510 --> 42:43.570
with Junior Xuan'er and Han Li,

42:44.000 --> 42:45.260
I just can't sit by and do nothing.

42:45.880 --> 42:47.010
Please allow me to go.

42:47.320 --> 42:48.690
Since you're willing,

42:49.320 --> 42:51.380
you and Junior Wu Xuan

42:52.070 --> 42:52.820
may go together.

42:53.440 --> 42:54.340
Thank you, Master.

42:54.920 --> 42:57.900
Let Moonshadow Sect's Xuan Yue lead the team.

43:00.400 --> 43:01.530
Xuan Yue accepts the order.

43:03.880 --> 43:04.740
All scouts,

43:05.030 --> 43:05.610
come with me!

43:06.230 --> 43:07.050
- Yes! - Yes!

43:14.000 --> 43:14.650
All disciples, hear this!

43:16.710 --> 43:17.610
The demonic sects

43:17.760 --> 43:18.980
have officially declared war on us.

43:19.400 --> 43:20.570
On orders from the elders,

43:21.800 --> 43:24.460
all Foundation and Qi Refining disciples

43:25.550 --> 43:26.340
of Yellow Maple Valley

43:26.800 --> 43:28.570
must now choose a battlefront

43:29.030 --> 43:29.900
and prepare to fight.

43:30.760 --> 43:31.260
In this war,

43:31.880 --> 43:32.380
we cannot retreat!

43:33.030 --> 43:33.610
We must not surrender!

43:34.030 --> 43:36.210
Any who defy orders will be severely punished!

43:37.150 --> 43:37.780
- Yes! - Yes!

43:54.020 --> 43:59.340
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

44:00.580 --> 44:05.980
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

44:06.100 --> 44:09.300
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

44:09.540 --> 44:11.780
♪Old scenes rise again♪

44:12.180 --> 44:15.020
♪Too hard to forget♪

44:15.540 --> 44:19.500
♪Easier just to miss♪

44:20.340 --> 44:25.820
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

44:26.980 --> 44:32.260
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

44:32.860 --> 44:35.900
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

44:36.180 --> 44:38.300
♪Swept away by time♪

44:38.940 --> 44:41.580
♪Eyes once looked far♪

44:42.060 --> 44:46.020
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:46.500 --> 44:49.340
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:49.620 --> 44:51.540
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:51.980 --> 44:54.420
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:54.740 --> 44:58.260
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:58.820 --> 45:01.780
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

45:02.100 --> 45:05.020
♪Time lost its name♪

45:05.420 --> 45:08.260
♪Was it yesterday♪

45:08.660 --> 45:12.220
♪Or tomorrow?♪

